# Longhorn Sharpshooter: "When this card becomes plotted, it deals 2 damage to any target" (CR 702.170a, 603.6, 120.3). Five Mox Rubies pay Plot {3}{R}: one R is left in the pool,
# so the cost was {3}{R} and no more. The trigger works from exile (CR 113.6k) and the Sharpshooter itself deals 2 to Bot2 (20 -> 18). On turn 3 it is cast for free from
# exile (CR 702.170d): no plotting, no trigger, no target is asked and Bot2 stays at 18. It is a 3/3 with reach.

